---
import StaggerHeading from '../StaggerHeading.astro';
---

<section class="manifesto" aria-labelledby="manifesto-title">
  <div class="container manifesto__grid">
    <div class="entry" data-reveal>
      <p class="entry__word" translate="no" data-stagger>loka</p>
      <p class="entry__meta label" data-stagger>
        <span lang="sa">लोक</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <span class="entry__ipa">/ˈloʊ.kə/</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
        <span>Sanskrit, noun</span>
      </p>
      <ol class="entry__senses" role="list" data-stagger>
        <li><span class="entry__n">1</span><span>A world; a realm or plane of existence.</span></li>
        <li><span class="entry__n">2</span><span><em>(to us)</em> What “local” sounds like, said quickly.</span></li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="manifesto__copy">
      <StaggerHeading id="manifesto-title" class="manifesto__title" text="Apps from another loka." />
      <div class="manifesto__prose" data-reveal>
        <p data-stagger>
          Most apps live somewhere else: on a server, behind an account, inside a subscription that renews every
          month. You never quite have them. You’re renting.
        </p>
        <p data-stagger>
          Ours come from a different world, the one in your pocket. They run on your phone, work without a
          connection and keep what they know about you right there on the device.
        </p>
        <blockquote class="manifesto__quote" data-stagger>
          <p>
            We rebuild the apps you’d normally rent. No subscriptions, no forced ads, no accounts. Everything
            lives on your phone, works offline and is yours.
          </p>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .manifesto {
    padding-block: var(--section);
  }
  .manifesto__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-8);
  }

  .entry {
    align-self: start;
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-4);
  }
  .entry__word {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(4.5rem, 2rem + 10vw, 10rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 0.8;
    letter-spacing: -0.055em;
    padding-bottom: 0.08em;
  }
  .entry__meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--s-2);
    padding-bottom: var(--s-4);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .entry__ipa {
    text-transform: none;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .entry__meta [lang='sa'] {
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.2em;
    letter-spacing: 0;
    text-transform: none;
  }
  .entry__senses {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-3);
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }
  .entry__senses li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.75rem 1fr;
  }
  .entry__n {
    font-family: var(--font-code);
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    color: var(--ink-2);
    padding-top: 0.3em;
  }
  .entry__senses em {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .manifesto__copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-6);
    align-content: start;
  }
  .manifesto__title {
    font-size: var(--step-3);
    line-height: 0.98;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }
  .manifesto__prose {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-5);
    max-width: 36rem;
    font-size: var(--step-1);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }
  .manifesto__quote {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: var(--s-3);
    padding-left: calc(var(--s-5) + 0.75rem);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .manifesto__quote::before,
  .manifesto__quote::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0.15em;
    bottom: 0.15em;
    background: var(--brand);
  }
  .manifesto__quote::before {
    left: 0;
    width: 0.5rem;
  }
  .manifesto__quote::after {
    left: 0.6875rem;
    width: 0.125rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 64rem) {
    .manifesto__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 5fr 7fr;
      column-gap: var(--s-9);
    }
    .entry {
      position: sticky;
      top: calc(var(--header-h) + var(--s-7));
    }
  }
</style>
